WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.380
Shopping for ski gear shouldn't mean opening twenty sale tabs, then

00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:06.520
finding out the bargain isn't even in your size.

00:00:09.260 --> 00:00:12.220
Meet FreshPowder. It brings ski and snowboard offers from

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.360
dozens of retailers into one place.

00:00:14.860 --> 00:00:17.620
It's free to browse, with no account or invite required.

00:00:21.210 --> 00:00:24.450
Here's the actual site. The default view focuses on equipment.

00:00:25.230 --> 00:00:28.810
Skis, boards, boots, bindings, helmets, and goggles.

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:32.090
Looking for clothing or accessories? Just switch them on.

00:00:35.200 --> 00:00:40.000
Let's find some skis. Open the filters, choose skis, and set a

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:40.220
budget.

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:44.600
You can narrow by brand, store, currency, and reported length.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.600
That gives you a smaller shortlist you can actually shop.

00:00:54.100 --> 00:00:58.060
Each card shows the retailer, listed price, discount, available

00:00:58.060 --> 00:00:59.180
sizes when reported,

00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:00.900
and when the offer was checked.

00:01:01.460 --> 00:01:04.420
Watch the currency and confirm your exact size at the store.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:07.400
The biggest percentage off isn't always the best fit.

00:01:12.960 --> 00:01:14.140
Already know the model you want?

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:16.840
Use Compare to see matched offers together.

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:20.320
Check the model year, sizes, and store before choosing.

00:01:20.880 --> 00:01:23.400
When an expert review is available, there's a link for more

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:23.900
context.

00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.560
FreshPowder checks sources daily.

00:01:32.160 --> 00:01:34.920
The store report shows what's working and where coverage is

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:35.260
limited,

00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:37.440
so you can see what sits behind the listings.

00:01:38.200 --> 00:01:40.180
Prices and stock can change after a check.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.130
And if you'd rather wait for an exceptional find,

00:01:46.490 --> 00:01:48.790
the rare-deal email list only needs your email.

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:52.170
Alerts are coming soon. Browsing is open right now.

00:01:54.300 --> 00:01:56.420
Find your next setup at FreshPowder.

00:01:56.980 --> 00:01:58.400
More mountain, less markup.
